{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22816","headline":"独树浦雨夜寄李六郎中 · 白居易","name":"独树浦雨夜寄李六郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忆两家同里巷，何曾一处不追随。\n闲游预算分朝日，静语多同待漏时。\n花下放狂冲黑饮，灯前起坐彻明棊。\n可知风雨孤舟夜，芦苇丛中作此诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}